<ResourceDictionary xmlns="https://github.com/avaloniaui"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

  <!--
    THE ONE LOCATION FOR THE MARK OF THE APPLIANCE.

    To put the mark of a brand in the software, change this file and no other
    file. The warm-up screen and the screensaver are the two users of the mark
    below, and no other part of the software reads it.

    The accent that the software uses before a person selects one is NOT here.
    It is UserSettings.AccentColor.

    The mark here is a placeholder. It is not the mark of a company and it must
    not become one that looks like the mark of a company.

    CAUTION: do not put a file of a brand in git. The owner of the appliance
    keeps that file and puts it here on the machine that makes the build.

    A designer gives a mark as the path of an SVG. Put that path in the
    StreamGeometry below.
  -->

  <!--
    The mark, in a box of 100 x 40. Each user gives Stretch="Uniform" and one
    dimension, thus this box is a proportion and not a quantity of pixels.
  -->
  <StreamGeometry x:Key="BrandMarkGeometry">M6,12 A6,6 0 0 1 12,18 V22 A6,6 0 0 1 6,28 A6,6 0 0 1 0,22 V18 A6,6 0 0 1 6,12 Z M28,6 A6,6 0 0 1 34,12 V28 A6,6 0 0 1 28,34 A6,6 0 0 1 22,28 V12 A6,6 0 0 1 28,6 Z M50,0 A6,6 0 0 1 56,6 V34 A6,6 0 0 1 50,40 A6,6 0 0 1 44,34 V6 A6,6 0 0 1 50,0 Z M72,6 A6,6 0 0 1 78,12 V28 A6,6 0 0 1 72,34 A6,6 0 0 1 66,28 V12 A6,6 0 0 1 72,6 Z M94,12 A6,6 0 0 1 100,18 V22 A6,6 0 0 1 94,28 A6,6 0 0 1 88,22 V18 A6,6 0 0 1 94,12 Z</StreamGeometry>

</ResourceDictionary>
